  "principles": [
    "Metalcore chassis on drop C# — palm-muted open-string chugs, double-tracked guitars (tight-identical in breakdowns, varied in verses, octave-split in choruses)",
    "Trance synths are a band member — gated supersaw stabs, arps and pads double the riff, pump against the kick and sweep open in every build",
    "Scream / clean contrast: screamed riff verses vs. a bright, auto-tuned sing-along chorus over VI-VII-i-III with china on quarters",
    "Synth-heavy breakdowns and random euro-dance breaks — kick and electronic layer double the chugs, wobble bass, tape-stop stops and tempo shifts"
  ],
  "references": [
    { "artist": "Attack Attack!", "song": "Stick Stickly" },
    { "artist": "Attack Attack!", "song": "Smokahontas" },
