    { "artist": "Abandon All Ships", "song": "Take One Last Breath" },
    { "artist": "Enter Shikari", "song": "Sorry, You're Not a Winner" }
  ],
  "research_sources": [
    "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crabcore (term from late-2000s metalcore, popularized by Attack Attack!)",
    "https://www.nme.com/blogs/nme-blogs/10-years-crabcore-metal-meme-2361620 (open-stringed chugging, scream-sing-scream structures)",
    "https://www.halloftheelders.com/crabcore (synth-heavy breakdowns, auto-tuned choruses, tempo-shifting riffs, drop C/C#, euro-dance breaks, china in choruses)",
    "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electronicore (metalcore + trance/electronica/dubstep; sequencers, synths, electronic drums; auto-tune)",
    "https://www.melodigging.com/genre/electronicore (i-VI-III-VII; supersaws, arps, wobble bass, sidechained pads, synths doubling guitars, electronic layers reinforcing kick/snare, filter/pitch risers, four-on-the-floor and halftime drums, form incl. build/drop)",
    "https://tunebat.com/Info/Stick-Stickly-Attack-Attack-/3QienJ6IMsUD8Mo24vITBg (Stick Stickly ~140 BPM, C# minor)",
    "https://www.prosoundweb.com/in-the-studio-techniques-for-double-tracking-guitars/ (two performances panned L/R; copy-paste is not a double)",
    "https://homerecording.com/bbs/threads/quad-tracking-guitars.334378/ (quad tracking: two per side; octave chords / different voicings on one side)",
    "https://www.ujam.com/fileadmin/products/Manuals/Beatmaker-2.1_User_Guide_2.1.pdf (Beatmaker instrument + style key layouts)",
    "https://xferrecords.com/web-manual/serum-2/using-knobs-and-sliders and https://xferrecords.com/forums/general/cc-for-serum (Serum MIDI Learn, CC1 only by default)"
  ],
  "sound_design": {
    "synth_presets": {
      "chords": "supersaw stab, trance gate (Serum 2)",
      "pad": "wide supersaw pad, sidechained (Vital)",
      "lead": "bright saw pluck arp (Serum 2)",
      "synth_bass": "growl/wobble bass with LFO on filter (Serum 2)"
    },
    "drum_samples": {},
    "fx_chain": ["noise_gate", "high_gain_amp", "cab_ir", "sidechain_compressor", "bus_glue", "limiter"],
    "notes": "Drums: Superior Drummer 3 kit + UJAM Beatmaker (EDEN suits the four-on-the-floor/trance layer) on the electronic layer. Guitars: Odin III in drop C#, L/R takes. Synths: Serum 2 / Vital — MIDI Learn filter cutoff to CC74, volume to CC7, the wobble to the filter lane. Melody track is the clean (auto-tuned) vocal line — render it with a choir/vocal synth or use it as a guide for a singer."
  },
  "notes": "Researched profile. Introduced: per-section double-track modes, electronic drum layer, controller automation (filter sweeps, sidechain pump, wobble, pitch risers/dives), section tempo changes, synth stabs locked to the riff (chords_style follow_riff), trance gates and instruments[].play_in."
